     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nthis may be a really interesting postdoc for some. And Bordeaux is a nice city, too ...</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  ---- Marc</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4747...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4747...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a>&gt; on behalf of Frederic Barraquand &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">frederic....@u-bordeaux.fr</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, July 11, 2023 14:30<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Re: [Postdoc] Integrated modelling of opportunistic and standardised biodiversity data</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div>Hello all, <br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;arial&quot;,&quot;helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;arial&quot;,&quot;helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\">We have a postdoc position in Bordeaux, France on joint modelling of opportunistic and standardised survey data using integrated models. The topic is broad and can be adapted to best fit the candidate&#39;s interests and skills. Duration 18\r\n to 24 months (depending on salary/experience) <a href=\"https://jobs.inrae.fr/en/ot-18028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://jobs.inrae.fr/en/ot-18028&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140787000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HPTuN1Q3yh9ZjJ03-Wp3v\">\r\nhttps://jobs.inrae.fr/en/ot-18028</a> Embedded within a larger project on statistical modelling of terrestrial biodiversity - please contact me for more context.\r\n<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\">Deadline July 31 (I previously sent this offer with a May 1 deadline but we&#39;re still looking, hence the extension).\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>Best regards, <br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>Frederic<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;new york&quot;,&quot;times&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,58,49)\"><strong>---</strong></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;new york&quot;,&quot;times&quot;,serif;color:rgb(68,58,49)\"><strong></strong></span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;arial&quot;,&quot;helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(68,58,49)\"><strong>Frederic Barraquand\r\n<br>\r\n</strong></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;arial&quot;,&quot;helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,157,224)\">Researcher</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;arial&quot;,&quot;helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,157,224)\">CNRS - Institute of Mathematics of Bordeaux</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,157,224)\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/fredbarraquand/home\" style=\"display:inline-block;color:rgb(0,157,224)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sites.google.com/site/fredbarraquand/home&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140787000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CGDBh_wuXOaDou2u-Ve5B\"></a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,157,224)\"><strong></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,157,224)\"><strong></strong></span></span></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,58,49)\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://statntheorecol.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://statntheorecol.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140787000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UbUW9ssLwTMeklNBmfoc4\">Statistical and Theoretical Ecology Group</a>\r\n</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,58,49)\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,157,224)\"></span></span></strong></span></span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.u-bordeaux.com/\" style=\"display:inline-block;color:rgb(51,51,51)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.u-bordeaux.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140787000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hn3GIm1HeIkmQVEI19kyI\"></a></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
