     "<div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Dear all,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please check out this <a href=\"https://hrms.iucn.org/vacancy/6525\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://hrms.iucn.org/vacancy/6525&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-7xXk9fblDPPQFxXM5Zg0\">statistical analyst position</a> to\r\njoin our <a href=\"https://www.traffic.org/what-we-do/thematic-issues/trade-monitoring/elephant-trade-information-system/#:~:text=Managed%20and%20operated%20by%20TRAFFIC,CITES%20decisions%20for%20elephant%20conservation.\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.traffic.org/what-we-do/thematic-issues/trade-monitoring/elephant-trade-information-system/%23:~:text%3DManaged%2520and%2520operated%2520by%2520TRAFFIC,CITES%2520decisions%2520for%2520elephant%2520conservation.&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tYLIMYFM-jJbn7fTUx4gh\">ETIS</a>\r\nteam at TRAFFIC! This is an exciting opportunity to develop and implement\r\nmodels on illegal trade in elephant and rhino specimens, and to inform\r\ninternational policy and decision-making by CITES Parties.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If interested, apply directly on the <a href=\"https://hrms.iucn.org/vacancy/6525\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://hrms.iucn.org/vacancy/6525&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-7xXk9fblDPPQFxXM5Zg0\">IUCN HRMS site</a>. Please note that\r\ncandidates must be able to work in the UK.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cheers,<br></p><div>Sharon</div><div><br></div><p></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Sharon Baruch-Mordo</span><br></p></div><div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div><div><p style=\"line-height:13.0pt;background:white\"><span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;color:#404040;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">TRAFFIC | Senior Specialist – Elephant and Rhino\r\nTrade<br>\r\n</span></b></span><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;color:gray;background:white\">David Attenborough\r\nBuilding, Pembroke Street, Cambridge, CB2 3QA</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:13.0pt;background:white\"><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;color:gray;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Email: </span></span><span></span><a href rel=\"nofollow\" data-email-masked><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;color:#2e74b5;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in;text-decoration:none\">Sharon.Ba...@traffic.org</span></span></a><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;color:gray;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"> <br>\r\n</span></span><span></span><a href=\"http://www.traffic.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.traffic.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QB3-IiH_IVIi2OijqtbBU\"><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;color:#5b9bd5;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Website</span></span><span></span></a><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;color:gray;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"> | </span></span><span></span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/trafficnetwork/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.facebook.com/trafficnetwork/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493140789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zvXBw0mEtZv4XaISdJPg3\"><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;color:#5b9bd5;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Facebook</span></span><span></span></a><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:sans-serif;co